Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.45,0:00:25.59,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Phew.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.43,0:00:40.35,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.90,0:00:47.31,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.55,0:02:24.01,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 6: THE FIRST DAY
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.46,0:02:22.44,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Oh, okay. So that's how \Nyou write "mushroom."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.83,0:02:26.77,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,Hello. I'm a magician's \Napprentice. My name is Lizel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.77,0:02:28.00,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Lize?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.23,0:02:30.22,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Oh. Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.95,0:02:33.01,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,Whoops! It's actually Lize.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.97,0:02:37.38,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,My name is Lize.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.71,0:02:42.26,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,My original name is Lizel, but \Nthat's what's called a "true name,"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.26,0:02:46.02,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,and I'm not allowed to \Nshare it with people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.30,0:02:51.78,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,It's the key that unlocks my magic, so \Nright now I should only say it in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.22,0:02:57.78,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Please stir what's in that pot for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:02:58.90,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.39,0:03:03.79,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,But use your magic to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.17,0:03:05.33,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.33,0:03:09.08,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,This is my mentor, the black witch Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.43,0:03:13.04,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,She always seems kind \Nof irritated with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.30,0:03:18.68,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,What were you doing so far out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.78,0:03:24.68,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I was writing in my diary just \Nlike you told me to, Miss Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:29.81,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I didn't understand magic language, \Nso I was a little nervous at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.81,0:03:33.34,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,but now that I can write what \NI'm thinking with thoughtography,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.34,0:03:36.45,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I have a lot of fun guessing which \Nwords have what letters in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.45,0:03:42.02,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I'm starting to really enjoy it. \NI'm learning a lot, so I'm glad I started!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.86,0:03:46.84,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Oh. What? It's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.84,0:03:49.74,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,But to tell the truth, Miss Witch...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.58,0:03:55.30,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,doesn't seem to be very \Ngood at staying irritated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.90,0:04:02.22,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Um, you really don't need to \Ndo all this. I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.45,0:04:05.22,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Huh? Whatever do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.98,0:04:12.62,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I don't know why, but she always \Nseems to have her hands full.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.85,0:04:16.24,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.47,0:04:19.67,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,No. I've decided to do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.87,0:04:31.24,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,Lize kind of sounds like a girl's name, \Nso I don't actually like it that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.95,0:04:39.79,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,But it's the name that Miss Witch \Ngave me, so it's very precious to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.47,0:04:43.43,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Even though she only \Ntook the "L" off the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.43,0:04:46.58,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,What's precious about it? \NThat's about as lazy as you can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.35,0:04:48.77,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.21,0:04:49.99,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.65,0:04:53.40,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,This huge grouch's name is Claude.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.40,0:04:55.45,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,He always barges in here
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.45,0:04:59.11,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,to grumble about something \Nwhen he's not even invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.11,0:05:00.40,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,He really bugs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.40,0:05:03.44,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,Well, he's always crowing about \Nstuff, so maybe he "birds" me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.87,0:05:06.91,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,Still, he has the personality \Nof a maggot, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.07,0:05:08.91,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.91,0:05:11.17,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,Yeah, let's say he bugs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.17,0:05:12.99,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,I'll kick your ass, you little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.46,0:05:15.42,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Claude?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.42,0:05:17.92,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Ask yourself that, punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:19.46,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Oh, Claude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.83,0:05:22.76,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,It's very rude to read \Nanother person's diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.19,0:05:26.38,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,When are you gonna learn to check \Nthat attitude of yours, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.75,0:05:28.27,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.27,0:05:33.27,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Miss Witch was very clear that if \Nanything makes me upset or sad,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.27,0:05:37.91,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I need to write it down in my diary \Nand not keep it bottled up,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.91,0:05:40.38,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,so the filth doesn't rot my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.99,0:05:43.78,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,So you're calling me rotten filth?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.69,0:05:51.16,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Luna! What the hell have you \Nbeen teaching this brat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.65,0:05:54.48,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Oh, please don't be angry with Miss Witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.48,0:05:57.54,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,It's okay! I feel better after \Nwriting my feelings down,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.54,0:06:00.82,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,so I'm not as disgusted by your \Npresence as I was a minute ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.82,0:06:03.68,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Just doubling down \Non the insults, are we?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.37,0:06:09.14,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,He can't help it, Claude. Lize \Nis a cursed youngling, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.14,0:06:12.58,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,He shouldn't be bottling toxic \Nfeelings up now, should he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.58,0:06:15.19,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Even little things can build \Nup if you're not careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.47,0:06:20.44,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,I don't want Luna to have to grow another \None of those huge, black mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.75,0:06:26.41,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Fine, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.41,0:06:28.87,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Do you really, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.87,0:06:32.29,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,You're always grumpy and you \Ntake it out on everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.29,0:06:37.81,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,We all have to set a good example so Lize \Ndoesn't turn into The End of All Things
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.81,0:06:39.55,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,since he doesn't understand all this yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.77,0:06:45.31,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,The cursed youngling, destined to one day \Nturn into The End of All Things. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.93,0:06:48.72,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You sure brought home a real \Nbundle of trouble this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.23,0:06:54.16,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Are you even aware of what \Nsort of mess you've dragged us all into?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.87,0:06:58.71,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about \Nwhat happens to the brat,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.13,0:07:03.72,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,but this was all your call, \Nso it's your responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.75,0:07:10.45,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Claude, you need to do something \Nabout that nasty attitude of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.45,0:07:12.94,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,You're not inspiring \Na lot of confidence, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.58,0:07:17.68,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Oh, I know! For dinner tonight \NI'll do a big beef spit roast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.68,0:07:20.32,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,I think crow pie would be a better choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.22,0:07:34.40,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,One day, these people saved me. \NI have no memories from before then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.10,0:07:40.10,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I don't know who I am or where I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.10,0:07:45.46,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I don't even know the real reason \Nwhy I have to keep a diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.02,0:07:47.61,Flashback_Italics,Claude (FB),0,0,0,,Tell us your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:49.60,Flashback,Lize,0,0,0,,It's Lizel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.78,0:07:59.90,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.69,0:08:06.52,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Did you just feel a blast of wind \Nfrom him the second he said his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.66,0:08:19.00,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Hey, you. Did you just \Nuse some kind of magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.46,0:08:22.16,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I... haven't...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.90,0:08:26.46,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,You should not use that name anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.46,0:08:27.46,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Luna?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.18,0:08:32.70,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened \Nto him, but I have a feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.70,0:08:35.68,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,he shouldn't be using that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:37.79,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,His true name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:39.15,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.38,0:08:43.44,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,I know that, unlike black witches,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.21,0:08:46.68,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,since the white witches \Nhave weak magical powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.68,0:08:50.34,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,they depend on contracts \Nand "spells" to use magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.94,0:08:54.37,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Also, since they are \Nbound to those spells,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.37,0:08:56.94,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,their "true names" are the \Nkeys to unlocking that magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.61,0:09:00.14,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Their true names are like weak spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.67,0:09:03.53,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Revealing them basically opens \Nthem up to be targeted by curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.53,0:09:07.32,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,What? What are these people talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.32,0:09:10.53,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,The fact that he would \Njust blurt it out to us
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.53,0:09:13.23,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,must mean he's seriously disoriented.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.32,0:09:16.05,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Do they mean me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.05,0:09:17.00,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.37,0:09:21.08,Flashback_Italics,Queen,0,0,0,,You are the one who should \Nnever have been born.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.05,0:09:31.10,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.69,0:09:34.00,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Who are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.97,0:09:37.68,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.93,0:09:40.07,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,How...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.99,0:09:42.92,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Who...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.82,0:09:47.39,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Who in the world am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.02,0:09:54.16,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Um, I believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.01,0:10:00.23,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,that I am in your debt. It seems \Nlike you must have rescued me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.23,0:10:02.74,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Thank you very much. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.77,0:10:09.62,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,should be going now. I wish I had \Nsomething to give you as thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.92,0:10:16.68,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,See? What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.16,0:10:20.12,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I'm hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.96,0:10:30.69,Italics,Lize,0,0,0,,Huh? A mushroom... doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.13,0:10:41.60,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,A transference doll, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.36,0:10:45.56,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,My wound got better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.52,0:10:48.73,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,No, it moved?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.19,0:10:51.53,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.38,0:10:56.14,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,You must now care diligently \Nfor this fellow,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.14,0:10:58.97,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,until he recovers from the injury \Nhe accepted in your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.55,0:11:00.34,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.97,0:11:03.58,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,That will be your first responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.41,0:11:05.89,Flashback_Italics,Claude,0,0,0,,Don't cut him any slack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.20,0:11:08.78,Flashback,Claude,0,0,0,,If you're gonna make him into a magician
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.33,0:11:12.24,Flashback,Claude,0,0,0,,and keep him from becoming a monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.34,0:11:14.86,Flashback,Claude,0,0,0,,you need to set your feelings aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.86,0:11:16.61,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,This is the black forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.55,0:11:19.09,Flashback,Claude,0,0,0,,You chose this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:22.96,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,And starting today,\Nthis house is where you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.42,0:11:27.62,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,You are not allowed to leave \Nthis place for any reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.25,0:11:30.63,Flashback_Italics,Claude,0,0,0,,Once you have become this kid's mentor...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.86,0:11:33.72,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I am the Champignon Witch. \NMy name is Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.16,0:11:39.26,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,And you are my apprentice, \Nhere to learn magic from me, Lize—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:43.39,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Don't use his true name!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.27,0:11:46.17,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Uh, Lize...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.84,0:11:50.77,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Lizela? Lizelo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:52.26,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Lizette.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.26,0:11:54.29,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,Isn't that a girl's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.03,0:11:56.19,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Lizotto.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.19,0:11:57.53,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,That sounds like food.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.53,0:12:02.32,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Isn't Lize good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:03.13,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.45,0:12:06.04,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,C'mon, Luna. You got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.54,0:12:15.84,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Uh... your name is Lize, \Nb-because it is. That is all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.16,0:12:25.93,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,That's right. Like the crow said,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.21,0:12:32.19,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,this name was picked on the spot and \Nhad an undeniably impulsive ring to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.53,0:12:35.94,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,But after I jotted it down in my diary,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.94,0:12:39.45,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I forgot all about how \Nit felt at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.45,0:12:43.98,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Anyway, never use your old name again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.45,0:12:48.14,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Also, don't get any funny \Nideas about running.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.59,0:12:50.48,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,If you run away, I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.89,0:12:57.65,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,So I'm an apprentice to a magician?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.97,0:13:00.12,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,To the Champignon Witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.92,0:13:03.96,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,That was my first day as \Na magician's apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.55,0:13:09.33,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,That night, I was still very anxious \Nand overwhelmed with uncertainty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.25,0:13:13.63,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,The black forest
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.05,0:13:18.13,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,is a place where evil spirits, \Ncriminals, and poison monsters live.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.13,0:13:19.73,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,It is an ominous place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.87,0:13:23.00,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,A black witch
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.55,0:13:27.48,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,is one who wields powerful magic, \Nrefuses to conform to others,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.48,0:13:31.66,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,and uses poison to conjure \Nand control monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:35.11,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,Her horrible actions throw communities \Nand countries into chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.11,0:13:36.96,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,She is a terrible witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.17,0:13:44.32,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.88,0:13:49.66,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Oh. I overslept?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.16,0:13:51.45,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.98,0:13:55.73,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,We're going to pick up ingredients \Nfor breakfast, so get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.73,0:13:56.82,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.13,0:14:01.46,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,Even though I don't have \Nany memory of who I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:04.11,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I do still seem to remember some things
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.70,0:14:08.37,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,that aren't strictly \Nrelated to my identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.37,0:14:13.12,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Oh. Th-Thanks for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.13,0:14:20.22,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,That includes rumors I'd heard \Nabout the Champignon Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.55,0:14:23.33,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Oh. The clothes are a perfect fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.03,0:14:27.73,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.14,0:14:34.96,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I heard she's a witch who looks \Nas dark and ugly as her personality,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.96,0:14:38.00,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,who emits a hideous, poisonous odor,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.00,0:14:40.81,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,and sprouts extremely toxic \Nmushrooms all around town,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.81,0:14:42.83,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,which causes problems for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.83,0:14:44.96,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Oh. Is this another mushroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.96,0:14:46.41,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Yeah, it sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.41,0:14:47.73,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,And it's okay to pick?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.73,0:14:48.90,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.37,0:14:55.62,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I want you to peel that mushroom, \Nchop it up into pieces,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:57.67,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,and then gently mash it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.67,0:15:02.81,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,This one had a clean and crisp fragrance \Nlike morning dew, green grass,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.81,0:15:05.08,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,and flowers all mixed together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.48,0:15:07.43,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,So maybe those rumors weren't quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.43,0:15:13.43,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,PEEL...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.44,0:15:21.44,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,CHOP, CHOP...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.88,0:15:18.09,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.72,0:15:31.06,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Y-You need to make much more of \Nan effort to do your chores with magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.45,0:15:33.45,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Starting immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.69,0:15:35.62,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.62,0:15:38.53,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,And you are forbidden from holding \Na knife for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.12,0:15:40.59,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Now, clean yourself off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.81,0:15:46.86,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,How annoying. It feels like I'm \Nnot used to this body, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.22,0:15:53.47,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,I think he's still a little too young \Nto be peeling things with a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.48,0:15:55.45,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.77,0:15:58.08,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Phew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.08,0:16:01.38,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,How embarrassing. I feel so immature,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.38,0:16:04.76,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,and I still don't know anything \Nabout using magic yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.76,0:16:08.49,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,How did I end up as \Na magician's apprentice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.66,0:16:13.24,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Oh. Um, some of the mash
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:14.86,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,got in your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.28,0:16:17.75,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Do not touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.99,0:16:22.58,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,You must never touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:25.74,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.74,0:16:27.54,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.40,0:16:31.40,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,She'll kill me if I run away. \NA terrible witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.52,0:16:37.52,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Let's dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.52,0:16:38.98,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.32,0:16:40.77,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,It looks so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:48.78,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,SHIITAKE PANCAKE RECIPE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.78,0:16:56.79,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,THE SECRET INGREDIENT IS "FEELING"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.79,0:17:02.79,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,FLUFF FLUFF...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.03,0:17:09.08,Default,Minos/Merino/Lize,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.75,0:17:17.32,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Now that I think of it, I haven't eaten \Na single thing since I woke up yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.31,0:17:24.46,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Maybe I didn't need to take \Nthose weird rumors so seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.32,0:17:28.33,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,It's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.33,0:17:29.45,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.54,0:17:38.48,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Luna, this is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.48,0:17:41.33,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,Just like the pancakes \Nthey made in that book!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.33,0:17:47.34,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Maybe if I were a cow or a sheep, \NI'd have thought it was delicious, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.34,0:17:52.03,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,That's what I thought of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.50,0:17:55.38,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,This is very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.85,0:17:59.24,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I exhaled that lie as easily \Nas I would a breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.79,0:18:05.40,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,But Miss Witch worked hard to make this \Nfor me. I've gotta try to finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.55,0:18:10.86,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Hey. What do you think you're doing, Luna?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.37,0:18:16.71,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,I thought you promised to make the kid \Nuse magic for all of his everyday tasks
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.71,0:18:20.09,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,to help him get better at \Nmagic quicker, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.05,0:18:23.10,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,The heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.62,0:18:25.06,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.58,0:18:27.81,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Did you make that for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.49,0:18:31.59,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Uh... well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.59,0:18:35.21,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You need to make him do all of \Nthe cooking with his own magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.21,0:18:37.42,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You aren't allowed to help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.83,0:18:40.16,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,But Lize hasn't gotten there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:44.10,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,He can't use magic at all yet. \NWe'd starve to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.10,0:18:45.61,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,That's the whole point, you ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.61,0:18:46.86,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,I'm a sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.35,0:18:50.82,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Sometimes new skills only appear \Nwhen you're backed into a corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.42,0:18:55.36,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,And you promised that was the way \Nyou were going to play this, Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.87,0:19:00.18,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,But you're already \Ntrying to pull this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.54,0:19:02.62,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You're not inspiring a lot of confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.53,0:19:05.62,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.85,0:19:07.72,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Do you even understand
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.05,0:19:11.12,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,the scale of the responsibility \Nthey've entrusted us with, here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.63,0:19:13.40,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Black fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.01,0:19:16.63,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,There's a black fog that comes \Nout of living creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.06,0:19:20.85,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I have a feeling I used to see it a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.39,0:19:25.14,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Anxiety, sadness, suffering,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.52,0:19:28.78,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,sickness, curses, hatred,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.09,0:19:32.53,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,madness, malice, sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.18,0:19:38.24,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,There are many toxic feelings that can \Narise from and then consume living beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.24,0:19:43.17,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,But this is the first time I've seen \Nit here. It's still kind of faint.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.91,0:19:49.92,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I know that bad things have happened \Nin places where the fog got thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.17,0:19:56.57,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,So I'd better...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.83,0:20:04.82,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Hey. What did you just do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:11.19,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh, I... there was a black fog...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.42,0:20:23.63,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Um, did I... do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.20,0:20:28.03,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Did you just say "black fog" to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.95,0:20:30.96,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Stay the hell away from that black fog,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.96,0:20:34.63,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,and never try to touch me... \Nme or Luna again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.63,0:20:40.64,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.64,0:20:45.89,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Why am I here? Why don't I know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.22,0:20:48.86,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,And what are these faint \Nwords I hear in my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.66,0:20:53.61,Flashback_Italics,Queen,0,0,0,,You are the one who should \Nnever have been born.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.61,0:20:56.40,Flashback_Italics,Mother,0,0,0,,You must never forget what your name is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.40,0:21:00.67,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Whose voices are these? \NAnd what was that black fog?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.67,0:21:05.05,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,How did I already know \Nabout it? What am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.95,0:21:07.85,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,That kid is a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.64,0:21:12.04,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,I doubt he even realizes he's already \Nsucking poisons out of people and things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.72,0:21:18.48,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,At this rate, he's gonna run out of time \Na whole lot sooner than we expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.49,0:21:21.97,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,But it isn't his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.19,0:21:27.62,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,We need to force him to learn some \Nkind of magic to deal with this
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.01,0:21:31.18,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,before his body absorbs more \Npoison than it can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.69,0:21:35.04,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,What are they talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.59,0:21:37.09,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Is it about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.21,0:21:40.65,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,That kid is a poisonous monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.19,0:21:43.28,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,The moment we determine he's a lost cause,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.91,0:21:45.76,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,there will be no choice but to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.93,0:21:51.71,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Is that what you want, Luna?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.23,0:21:55.57,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,If you keep going this easy on him, \Nthat's exactly what will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.72,0:22:03.03,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,But if I can use mushrooms to suck out\N the poison collected in his body,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.03,0:22:05.97,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,we shouldn't have to rush \Nto a decision that quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.97,0:22:09.29,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Yeah, but we already talked \Nabout what a huge risk that—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.59,0:22:18.48,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Lize, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.08,0:22:38.21,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,TRANSLATION: MICHAEL ARNOLD
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.33,0:22:41.42,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,SUBTITLE TIMING: ANDY ELLIS\NEDITING: ELISABETH CRIST
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.75,0:22:46.13,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,QUALITY CHECK: GABRIELLA ALABANZA\NTRANSLATION CHECK: MICHELLE TYMON
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.61,0:24:10.25,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,NEXT TIME: THE MAGIC DIARY
